{"text":"We are no longer in those times, these are no longer boom years, these are no longer peaceful times, and those models cannot work today. Here's another one. Mass layoffs. Using someone's livelihood to balance the books, right? It's so normal in America today that we don't even understand how broken and how damaging it is, not only to human beings, but to business. You know, companies talk about how they want to build trust and cooperation and they announce a round of layoffs. Do you know the quickest way to destroy trust and destroy cooperation in a business, literally in one day? Lay people off. And everyone gets scared. Can you imagine sending someone home to say, honey, I can no longer provide for our family because the company missed its arbitrary projections this year?","words":[{"text":"We","start":0.0,"end":0.58},{"text":"are","start":0.58,"end":0.72},{"text":"no","start":0.72,"end":0.94},{"text":"longer","start":0.94,"end":1.26},{"text":"in","start":1.26,"end":1.48},{"text":"those","start":1.48,"end":1.72},{"text":"times","start":1.72,"end":2.12,"punct":","},{"text":"these","start":2.78,"end":2.8},{"text":"are","start":2.8,"end":2.94},{"text":"no","start":2.94,"end":3.18},{"text":"longer","start":3.18,"end":3.62},{"text":"boom","start":3.62,"end":3.88},{"text":"years","start":3.88,"end":4.3,"punct":","},{"text":"these","start":4.88,"end":4.96},{"text":"are","start":4.96,"end":5.1},{"text":"no","start":5.1,"end":5.34},{"text":"longer","start":5.34,"end":5.74},{"text":"peaceful","start":5.74,"end":6.12},{"text":"times","start":6.12,"end":6.68,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":6.96,"end":7.2},{"text":"those","start":7.2,"end":7.54},{"text":"models","start":7.54,"end":7.96},{"text":"cannot","start":7.96,"end":8.38},{"text":"work","start":8.38,"end":8.9},{"text":"today","start":8.9,"end":9.42,"punct":"."},{"text":"Here's","start":10.58,"end":10.7},{"text":"another","start":10.7,"end":10.9},{"text":"one","start":10.9,"end":11.54,"punct":"."},{"text":"Mas